          {
            "resourceId": "pack_lelu_godot_magic_projectiles_premium_demo_project::credits.txt",
            "path": "credits.txt",
            "text": "\r\nHi,\r\nHere is the Magic Projectiles Premium edition file.. \r\nwhich includes 19 VFX effects (7 Magic projectiles, 7 Hit effects, 5 Muzzle effects) that I've created for the tutorial \"GODOT 4 - Magic Projectiles (fire ball)\"\r\nincluding also all the textures i've used. \r\n\r\nI haven't dont all the assets (3D models, and addons), here you can find the sources i've used:\r\n\r\n\r\nCREDITS:\r\n\r\n\"Magic Witch\" (https://skfb.ly/6yJvG) by Catarina Cerqueira is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).\r\n\r\n\"Animated Training Dummy\" (https://skfb.ly/6TFJo) by FunkyDealer is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/).\r\n\r\n\"Simple Free-Look Camera for Godot 4\" Submitted by user AlanRichard; MIT; 2022-12-04  (https://godotengine.org/asset-library/asset/1561)\r\n\r\n\"Motion Trail Plugin\" by metanoia with help of aboudaladdin and emirthab  (https://github.com/metanoia83/Godot-4.0-Motion-Trail)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTHANK YOU SO MUCH !!  :3",
            "scope": "file_or_subtree_evidence; do not apply an addon license to the whole VFX pack"
          },
          {
            "resourceId": "pack_lelu_godot_magic_projectiles_premium_demo_project::readme2.txt",
            "path": "readme2.txt",
            "text": "NOTE: Maybe you need to restart the project 2 times, since it has a pre build-tool.",
            "scope": "file_or_subtree_evidence; do not apply an addon license to the whole VFX pack"
          }
